### Normalized scores (1–100)

- **Tool use: 76/100.** Evidence TB ~65% ; Tau ~60%; capped by missing Claw-Eval/Tau3 isolation.
- **Reasoning: 76/100.** Evidence GPQA ~75% ; MMLU 80%+; capped by incomplete HLE/MRCR.
- **Context window: 72/100.** 128K context — tiered per methodology (≥1M=95-100, 200K=70, 256K≈72).
- **Multimodal: 50/100.** Text in/out only; scored per multimodal rubric (text-only 15, image 60-70, video/PDF 75-90, audio-in 90-100).
- **Coding: 80/100.** Evidence LiveCode 82% ; SWE ~55%; capped by missing isolated LiveCode/SciCode where noted.
- **Cost efficiency: 70/100.** Paid $0.20/$0.80 per 1M (31B).
- **Overall Score: 71/100.** Mean of five non-cost dims (76+76+72+50+80)/5=70.8 → 71; best-fit per scoring methodology.

